event: thinking
data: {"id": "5cafa123668a4458-thinking-parallel_evidence-564", "run_id": "5cafa123668a4458", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已采集的事实，说明如下：\n\n## 已确认事实\n1.  **实体身份**：Pod `workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l` (UID: `13aa0496-5af5-4103-882f-2a096df0dc3f`) 运行在 `aiops-case-09` 命名空间的 `node2` 上。\n2.  **当前状态**：Pod 状态为 `Running`，但 `READY` 为 `0/1`，且 `NotReady`。\n3.  **NotReady 的直接原因**：kubelet 的 Readiness Probe 失败。\n    - 早期阶段显示 `connection refused` (端口 8080)。\n    - 当前阶段（持续 58 分钟）显示 `HTTP probe failed with statuscode: 503`。\n4.  **应用行为**：Pod 日志显示，应用在路径 `/work` 上持续返回 **HTTP 503 'dependency unavailable'** (Trace ID: `44b78290-5799-4dda-8400-46851", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788810857915, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

